msgid "settings:other/mesh-settings/root-bone"
msgstr "根骨骼"

msgid "settings:other/mesh-settings/bounds"
msgstr "边界框"

msgid "settings:other/mesh-settings/description"
msgstr ""
"启用此功能后，可以统一头像的 Root Bone 和 Bounds。\n"
"如果头像根节点中有 MA MeshSettings，将覆盖其内容；若没有则新建。\n"
"如果头像中存在其他 MA MeshSettings，除【未设置】外的所有组件都将改为【继承】。"

